{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object visible, approach and grab it. If obstacle, avoid it or move forward. Scan environment finally.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = ScanEnvironment    /> <Action ID = AvoidObstacle    /> <Action ID = MoveForward    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObstacleAhead    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    />",
